/en/presentation  /en/strategic-storytelling/  301
/en/presentation/*  /en/strategic-storytelling/:splat  301
/id/presentasi  /id/storytelling-strategis/  301
/id/presentasi/*  /id/storytelling-strategis/:splat  301
/en/work  /en/  301
